# Pairs with OwnSagaCommitNeedsDurableDecision. The abort borrows the prepare's
# authority on the strength of the cached shadow alone.
MODULE: PeerRestoreAbortUndecidedElevated
TARGET: OwnSagaCommitNeedsDurableDecision
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an own-saga abort without a durable Abort decision runs with the prepare's authority
PERTURBS: Abort

--- FIND
ELSE IF read = "abort" /\ cached THEN "decided"
--- REPLACE
ELSE IF cached THEN "decided"
--- END
